  "Question": "In \\(\\triangle ABC,\\) \\(AB = 13,\\) \\(AC = 5\\) and \\(BC = 12.\\) Points \\(M\\) and \\(N\\) lie on \\(\\overline{AC}\\) and \\(\\overline{BC},\\) respectively, with \\(CM = CN = 4.\\) Points \\(J\\) and \\(K\\) are on \\(\\overline{AB}\\) so that \\(\\overline{MJ}\\) and \\(\\overline{NK}\\) are perpendicular to \\(\\overline{AB}.\\) What is the area of pentagon \\(CMJKN?\\)\n\n[Figure 1](figures/2004_AMC_12B_Q14_question_fig1.svg)",
